<title>USA: AlliedSignal to supply engines for RJ-85.</title>
<headline>AlliedSignal to supply engines for RJ-85.</headline>
<text>
<p>TORRANCE, Calif, Feb 12 - AlliedSignal Inc said it will supply its LF507 engines for 12 Canadair RJ-85 aircraft purchased by Northwest Airlines in a contract valued at $60 million.</p>
<p>The 75-passenger regional aircraft will be used by Northwest for domestic commuter routes in the U.S. deliveries of LF507 engines already begun, it said.</p>
</text>
